  "description": "Oh Dok-Hee, the drummer of Bold Rabbit, an indie band on the verge of breaking out, is offered a high-profile photoshoot. Initially hesitant and shy in front of the camera, he agrees when he learns that the photographer is Myung Lee-Jin, someone Dok-Hee has admired for years. \n\nWhat begins as a simple photoshoot quickly spirals into confusion when Lee-Jin misunderstands Dok-Hee. In an attempt to clear things up, Dok-Hee seduces him into intercourse. As the lines between desire and misunderstanding blur, Dok-Hee finds himself entangled in emotions he can barely control. \n\nWill Dok-Hee’s hidden love finally reach Lee-Jin, or will everything unravel before it even begins?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
